                  "size": 0,
                  "column": "0",
                  "row": "0"
                }
              },
              "elements": [
                {
                  "id": "b5b1025e",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Article Toc",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-article-toc",
                    "editor": "<details open><summary>In this article</summary><ol>\n<li><a href=\"#article-section-1\">Begin with the promise</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#article-section-2\">Give each element a job</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#article-section-3\">Check the path through the page</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#article-section-4\">Keep the claims grounded</a></li>\n</ol></details>"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "44754d92",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Editorial Art",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-editorial-art",
                    "editor": "<figure class=\"gp-concept-figure\"><div class=\"gp-concept-title\"><p>Give the promise a clear shape.</p></div>\n<div class=\"gp-concept-nodes\">\n<div class=\"gp-concept-node\">\n<span class=\"gp-concept-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Cover &amp; title</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gp-concept-node\">\n<span class=\"gp-concept-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Description</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gp-concept-node\">\n<span class=\"gp-concept-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Book details</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figcaption>Illustrative product-page structure</figcaption></figure>"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "ee601e20",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "heading",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Subheading",
                    "_element_id": "article-section-1",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-subheading",
                    "title": "Begin with the promise",
                    "header_size": "h2"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "f729a5b4",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Copy",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-copy",
                    "editor": "<p>The first part of a description should establish a reason to keep reading. For fiction, that may be the central situation, conflict or emotional tension. For nonfiction, it may be the problem, perspective or practical value.</p>"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "02bd94a2",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Copy",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-copy",
                    "editor": "<p>Avoid forcing the reader to work through a long introduction before understanding the book. Try reading only the opening lines on a phone. What do they tell someone who has never heard of the author?</p>"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "5b58679f",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "heading",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Subheading",
                    "_element_id": "article-section-2",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-subheading",
                    "title": "Give each element a job",
                    "header_size": "h2"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "f0d8b972",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Copy",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-copy",
                    "editor": "<p>The cover introduces the book visually. The description develops its promise. Supporting content can explain themes, reading order or useful details. These pieces should support one another without repeating the same vague claim in different formats.</p>"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "33eb252f",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Copy",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-copy",
                    "editor": "<p>If you use A+ Content, plan its message before designing the images. Ask what a reader needs to understand at each point. Decorative space alone does not answer a buying question.</p>"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "c746cbc7",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "heading",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Subheading",
                    "_element_id": "article-section-3",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-subheading",
                    "title": "Check the path through the page",
                    "header_size": "h2"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "90f24911",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Copy",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-copy",
                    "editor": "<p>Read the listing from top to bottom. Note where the message becomes repetitive, where important context is missing and where the reader may misunderstand the book’s format or place in a series.</p>"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "9d23b6f5",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Copy",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-copy",
                    "editor": "<p>Check mobile readability too. Small text inside an image may look attractive in a desktop design file but become difficult to read on a smaller screen.</p>"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "c5bd53a6",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "heading",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Subheading",
                    "_element_id": "article-section-4",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-subheading",
                    "title": "Keep the claims grounded",
                    "header_size": "h2"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "64b1798a",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Copy",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-copy",
                    "editor": "<p>Use specific details from the book instead of promises you cannot support. A description should help the right reader make a decision, not suggest that every reader will have the same response.</p>"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "c6fa67ba",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Copy",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-copy",
                    "editor": "<p>A useful review produces a short list of changes with reasons: what is unclear, what should change and how the revision better represents the actual book.</p>"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                },
